              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Most teams already have a coding agent. Ask it for a small tool, such as a ticket board or a release checklist, and it writes one in minutes. Then the tool needs a place to run, somewhere to keep its data, and a way to work with your other tools. That part still takes days.",
